emonic sentence is a group of easy to remember letters.\",\n      \"line\": 4,\n      \"span\": \"a group of easy to remember letters\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"BIP 39 consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\",\n      \"line\": 6,\n      \"span\": \"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a ASCII seed.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"The ASCII seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\",\n      \"line\": 6,\n      \"span\": \"This seed can be later used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"BIP 39 falls under the GPL License.\",\n      \"line\": 9,\n      \"span\": \"This BIP falls under the GPL License.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"A mnemonic sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\",\n      \"line\": 12,\n      \"span\": \"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"User-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\",\n      \"line\": 14,\n      \"span\": \"user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets)\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```","ttft_ms":74687,"type":"result","duration_ms":77588,"uuid":"6276d5da-19f5-458b-8cfd-f79dc6156afc","ttft_stream_ms":956,"time_to_request_ms":121,"first_content_frame_ms":956,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
